{'symbol': 'NSC', 'date': '2023-04-26 08:00:00', 'title': 'NORFOLK SOUTHERN REPORTS FIRST QUARTER 2023 RESULTS', 'text': 'ATLANTA , APRIL 26, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NORFOLK SOUTHERN CORPORATION (NYSE: NSC) ANNOUNCED WEDNESDAY ITS FIRST QUARTER 2023 FINANCIAL RESULTS. FOR THE QUARTER, INCOME FROM RAILWAY OPERATIONS WAS $711 MILLION, AND DILUTED EARNINGS PER SHARE WERE $2.04\xa0– DOWN BY 34% AND 30%, RESPECTIVELY, COMPARED TO THE FIRST QUARTER 2022.'}